# Scrollable Analysis editor header and on-demand icon picker

Refine both Analysis editors so ownership scrolls with the content and icon choices appear only when requested.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] The player selector is part of the editor's scrollable content and is not fixed above or below it.
- [ ] Scrolling a long construction plan moves the player selector naturally with the editor content.
- [ ] The current item icon appears beside the editable name.
- [ ] A small pencil affordance beside the icon communicates that it can be changed.
- [ ] The 3×3 icon grid is hidden by default.
- [ ] Tapping the current icon or its pencil reveals the shared 3×3 icon grid.
- [ ] Selecting an icon updates the draft and dismisses or collapses the picker without changing unrelated fields.
- [ ] Production and Plan editors retain their respective cards and hammer defaults.
- [ ] Cancel discards an icon change; Save persists it through TASK-033's storage path.
- [ ] Editor scrolling, naming, player changes, preview placement, Clear, Cancel, and Save continue to work.
- [ ] UI regression coverage compiles.
- [ ] Focused layout and interaction checks pass on a functioning simulator or device.
